WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.403
Kip was sad.

2
00:00:08.404 --> 00:00:18.173
He wanted to have a great birthday party.

3
00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:23.102
But he didn't have cupcakes.

4
00:00:23.103 --> 00:00:33.100
He didn't have party games.

5
00:00:33.101 --> 00:00:39.454
He didn't have decorations.

6
00:00:39.455 --> 00:00:43.000
And he forgot to invite everyone.

7
00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:48.945
"This is terrible," said Kip.

8
00:00:48.946 --> 00:00:53.460
"I think I'll just go home."

9
00:00:53.461 --> 00:00:56.753
Kip started to walk home when suddenly . . .

10
00:00:56.754 --> 00:01:00.786
All of Kip's friends jumped out!

11
00:01:00.787 --> 00:01:04.682
"Surprise!" they all yelled.

12
00:01:04.683 --> 00:01:07.672
"Happy Birthday, Kip!" said Bird.

13
00:01:07.673 --> 00:01:10.287
"We're here for your party!"

14
00:01:10.288 --> 00:01:14.142
"There is no party," said Kip.

15
00:01:14.143 --> 00:01:17.257
"I messed up everything."

16
00:01:17.258 --> 00:01:31.593
"No problem," said Bird.

17
00:01:31.594 --> 00:01:36.325
"We brought cupcakes, games, and decorations!"

18
00:01:36.326 --> 00:01:39.746
"You brought a whole party!" said Kip.

19
00:01:39.747 --> 00:01:48.023
Everyone played party games.

20
00:01:48.024 --> 00:01:53.764
Then they sang "Happy Birthday" to Kip.

21
00:01:53.765 --> 00:01:58.181
Kip blew out the candles.

22
00:01:58.182 --> 00:02:02.009
"What did you wish for?" asked Bird.

23
00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:05.883
"Nothing," said Kip.

24
00:02:05.884 --> 00:02:13.403
"I already have everything I need right here!"

